#: ../../source/evaluation/test-evaluation.md:1
#: baeb273b646545e1a012fd6a6e9d8835
msgid "独立测试集评估"
msgstr "Standalone Test Set Evaluation"

#: ../../source/evaluation/test-evaluation.md:3
#: 18afbca7b9a842fe8eee764e64cb7941
msgid "在模型训练完成后，框架会在测试集上自动执行最终评测。但在以下研究场景中，独立评估工具 `evaluate.py` 非常有用："
msgstr ""
"After model training completes, the framework automatically performs "
"final evaluation on the test set. However, the standalone evaluation tool"
" `evaluate.py` is invaluable in the following research scenarios:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/test-evaluation.md:4
#: ed8ee5b71f924e2e986912a5bc007280
msgid "训练时使用了 `--general.skip_test true` 跳过了测试集评测。"
msgstr ""
"Training was run with `--general.skip_test true` to bypass test set "
"evaluation."

#: ../../source/evaluation/test-evaluation.md:5
#: 1421ecb09aaf432e9453cd376e98ca91
msgid "需要切换计算设备（例如在无 GPU 的机器上使用 `--general.device cpu` 验证）。"
msgstr ""
"Switching compute devices is required (e.g., verifying on a machine "
"without GPUs using `--general.device cpu`)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/test-evaluation.md:6
#: ff6dfbc6ba6c4666a9c73d8a5a46444b
msgid "需测试 `last_checkpoint.pth` 与 `best_model.pth` 的性能差异。"
msgstr ""
"Testing the performance difference between `last_checkpoint.pth` and "
"`best_model.pth` is needed."

#: ../../source/evaluation/test-evaluation.md:8
#: 6bf6bee3286b4f2f8ee193206e833846
msgid "运行独立评估"
msgstr "Running Standalone Evaluation"

#: ../../source/evaluation/test-evaluation.md:10
#: 3a6b8d3a9b4044ba8882b6a7569e925a
msgid "`evaluate.py` 会自动读取训练目录下归档的 `run_config.yaml`，完全恢复原模型的超参数与网络结构："
msgstr ""
"`evaluate.py` automatically reads the archived `run_config.yaml` in the "
"training directory, fully reconstructing the original model's "
"hyperparameters and architecture:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/test-evaluation.md:12
#: b0d5197d493a40c0bbaa672092bf8bd2
msgid ""
"python evaluate.py --evaluate.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128\n"
msgstr ""
"python evaluate.py --evaluate.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/test-evaluation.md:16
#: 3cd1dfcaa26c46f4b435c551c3ace692
msgid "常用评估选项"
msgstr "Common Evaluation Options"

#: ../../source/evaluation/test-evaluation.md:18
#: a0569ebc72864ea3b83b560ce3f38c75
msgid ""
"# 评估最后轮次的检查点（而非默认的 best_model.pth）\n"
"python evaluate.py \\\n"
"  --evaluate.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128 \\\n"
"  --evaluate.checkpoint last_checkpoint.pth\n"
"\n"
"# 临时覆盖评估设备与批大小\n"
"python evaluate.py \\\n"
"  --evaluate.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128 \\\n"
"  --general.device cpu \\\n"
"  --model.batch_size 256\n"
msgstr ""
"# Evaluate final epoch checkpoint (instead of default best_model.pth)\n"
"python evaluate.py \\\n"
"  --evaluate.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128 \\\n"
"  --evaluate.checkpoint last_checkpoint.pth\n"
"\n"
"# Temporarily override evaluation device and batch size\n"
"python evaluate.py \\\n"
"  --evaluate.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128 \\\n"
"  --general.device cpu \\\n"
"  --model.batch_size 256\n"

